{"id":486,"flavor":[{"games":["Legends: Arceus"],"text":"According to legend, Regigigas pulled landmasses together and bound them with rope to create the continent of Hisui. Though I have my doubts, the story could well contain a shred of truth."},{"games":["Shield"],"text":"It’s said that Regigigas created other Pokémon from many different materials before it moved the continents to where they are today."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"All over the world, there are legends that tell of Regigigas creating other Pokémon in its own image."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Y","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"There is an enduring legend that states this Pokémon towed continents with ropes."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","X","White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum"],"text":"It is said to have made Pokémon that look like itself from a special ice mountain, rocks, and magma."},{"games":["SoulSilver","HeartGold"],"text":"It is believed to have shaped REGIROCK, REGICE, and REGISTEEL out of clay, ice, and magma."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Slow Start","hidden":false,"description":"For five turns, the Pokémon's Attack and Speed stats are halved."}],"eggGroups":["Undiscovered"],"genderRate":-1,"hatchCounter":120,"baseHappiness":0,"growthRate":"slow","habitat":null,"color":"White","shape":"Humanoid","evolution":{"id":486,"name":"Regigigas","condition":null,"children":[]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[1,1],[1,109],[6,371],[12,263],[18,23],[24,182],[30,282],[36,5],[42,776],[48,469],[54,428],[60,484],[66,359],[72,416],[78,462]],"machine":[419,776,34,280,523,109,38,409,414,89,203,263,7,374,411,264,416,356,912,535,484,667,63,8,196,442,282,182,240,156,157,317,214,479,707,444,164,241,851,87,9,86,85,428],"egg":[],"tutor":[]},"cards":[{"id":"sv8pt5-86","name":"Regigigas","set":"Prismatic Evolutions","date":"2025-01-17","rarity":"Uncommon","number":"86","artist":null,"img":"sv8pt5/86"},{"id":"swsh12pt5-113","name":"Regigigas V","set":"Crown Zenith","date":"2023-01-20","rarity":"Rare Holo V